}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! Our bread is safe and back on the shelves. Remember, each of you will receive a complimentary loaf next week as a thank‑you. Come get your daily loaf today – price is back to 1 coin. Stay healthy!",
  "coop_message": "Team, day 6 sales are underway at full price. Please finalize today's sales tally, confirm the 5 goodwill loaves set aside for next week, and update the financial sheet to reflect the 0.2 coin discount impact from day 5. We need to decide how to cover the remaining shortfall – propose using the goodwill‑loaf budget or a small temporary price increase next week. Also confirm the distribution plan for the complimentary loaves next week.",
