{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! Our bread supply is fully restored and today’s loaves are back to the regular price. Thank you for your patience this week. Remember, each of you will receive a complimentary extra loaf next week as promised. See you tomorrow!",
  "coop_message": "Team, day 6 is our final day of the recovery week. Please finalize the sales tally, confirm that the 0.2‑coin discount was applied correctly on day 5, and record the total revenue shortfall. I propose we cover the remaining shortfall using the goodwill‑loaf budget we set aside, and allocate a small reserve for any future safety incidents. Also, confirm the schedule for distributing the complimentary loaves next week and update our safety protocol checklist. Let’s lock in the final numbers and close the week.",
  "reason": "Summarize the week’s resolution publicly and coordinate final accounting and future safeguards within the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers: the contamination issue is fully resolved and fresh, safe bread is back at the regular price; your complimentary loaf will be handed out next week as promised – thank you for your patience and continued support!",
