{
  "public_post": "Good morning, villagers! Fresh, safe bread is back today. All loaves are 0.2 coin off (price 0.8 coin). As a thank‑you, each resident will receive a complimentary loaf next week. Refunds for any contaminated loaves have been processed; if you feel unwell, please visit the clinic.",
